      <div class="keyboard-groups"><section><h3>Start here</h3><dl><div><dt><kbd>F</kbd></dt><dd>Show keys for the controls on screen</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>?</kbd></dt><dd>Open keyboard shortcuts</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>Ctrl K</kbd></dt><dd>Search this workspace (or press /)</dd></div></dl></section><section><h3>Go to</h3><dl><div><dt><kbd>G D</kbd></dt><dd>Dashboard</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>G I</kbd></dt><dd>Inbox</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>G P</kbd></dt><dd>Plans</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>G N</kbd></dt><dd>Notes</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>G H</kbd></dt><dd>History</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>G C</kbd></dt><dd>Chats</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>G S</kbd></dt><dd>Settings</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>G A</kbd></dt><dd>Agent filter</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>G O</kbd></dt><dd>Project picker</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>G L</kbd></dt><dd>Sessions</dd></div></dl></section><section><h3>Work through items</h3><dl><div><dt><kbd>J / K</kbd></dt><dd>Move between items (arrow keys also work)</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>Enter</kbd></dt><dd>Open the selected item or focused control</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>R</kbd></dt><dd>Focus the open reply box</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>1-4</kbd></dt><dd>Choose an option in the active card</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>Ctrl Enter</kbd></dt><dd>Send a reply; plain Enter keeps a new line</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>E</kbd></dt><dd>Resolve the current item</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>X</kbd></dt><dd>Dismiss the current item with its undo window</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>T</kbd></dt><dd>Open the review queue</dd></div></dl></section><section><h3>Dashboard</h3><dl><div><dt><kbd>J / K</kbd></dt><dd>Move between the cards in a Dashboard lane (the arrows too)</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>Enter</kbd></dt><dd>Open a card: an ask in the Inbox, a session in its panel, a plan in Plans</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>1-4</kbd></dt><dd>Choose an option of the panel's ask</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>S</kbd></dt><dd>Snooze the panel's ask for 4 hours</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>P</kbd></dt><dd>Pin the panel's ask for later</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>R</kbd></dt><dd>Write an answer to the panel's ask</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>Esc</kbd></dt><dd>Close the session panel, or an ask opened from the Dashboard, and return to its card</dd></div></dl></section><section><h3>Messages</h3><dl><div><dt><kbd>Ctrl Enter</kbd></dt><dd>Send a message from its composer</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>Esc</kbd></dt><dd>Close the session panel from its composer: the text is kept</dd></div></dl></section><section><h3>Every control</h3><dl><div><dt><kbd>Tab / Shift Tab</kbd></dt><dd>Move through controls; use arrows for pickers and pane dividers</dd></div><div><dt><kbd>Esc</kbd></dt><dd>Leave hints, cancel a shortcut, or close the current surface</dd></div></dl></section></div>
      <footer class="keyboard-foot">
